## Edge Cases

### Messy Handwriting

Handling:

- flag for review
- avoid confident auto-save when uncertain

### Blurry Photo

Handling:

- return image-quality warning
- do not create bad task records

### No Page Date Written

Handling:

- save upload date as capture date
- keep page date separate if identified later

### Mixed Notes and Tasks

Handling:

- distinguish likely tasks from non-task lines
- keep raw source text when needed

### Repeated Recurring Tasks

Example:

- gym every day

Handling:

- do not auto-merge recurring daily tasks globally
- use date context before treating something as a duplicate

### Ambiguous Update Commands

Example:

- “mark it done”

Handling:

- only update when a clear target exists
- otherwise return likely matches

### Bulk Updates

Example:

- “complete all personal tasks from today”

Handling:

- allow only clearly filtered batch updates

### Chat Deletion

Handling:

- no problem, because Google Sheets stores the real state

