## Google Sheets Design

Use Google Sheets as the primary task database.

### Sheet 1: Tasks

Columns:

- Task ID
- Raw Text
- Normalized Title
- Category
- Status
- Page Date
- Capture Date
- Source Type
- Source Reference
- Duplicate Flag
- Review Required
- Created At
- Updated At
- Completion Date

### Sheet 2: Status Log

Columns:

- Log ID
- Task ID
- Old Status
- New Status
- Changed At
- Change Source

### Sheet 3: Config

Suggested columns or keys:

- Allowed Statuses
- Allowed Categories
- Duplicate Time Window
- Notion Sync Enabled

This structure is intentionally simple, readable, and easy to inspect manually.

---

## Notion Design

Use a single Notion database as a mirrored viewing layer.

Suggested views:

- Pending
- Done Today
- In Progress
- Personal
- Kouch
- Needs Review

Notion should remain a convenience layer, not the canonical system.

