## ngrok Role

ngrok is appropriate for the MVP because it exposes the backend quickly for Custom GPT actions.

For the 30-day MVP it is:

- good enough for development and early testing
- simple to wire into the Custom GPT action

Later it can be replaced with a stable domain or reverse proxy.

